The face the handset's type roles resolve against (plan 0077 stage 1),
vendored so `go:embed` can reach it (embed only takes in-module files).
SIL OFL 1.1 — the license text sits beside the ttfs.

  AtkinsonHyperlegible-Bold.ttf,          ATKINSON-LICENSE.txt
  AtkinsonHyperlegible-Regular.ttf
    https://www.brailleinstitute.org/freefont/
    (also https://github.com/googlefonts/atkinson-hyperlegible)

Atkinson Hyperlegible has no Medium cut, so the strike table maps its
"medium" entries to the Regular ttf.

Atkinson is the SETTLED face (owner on-panel A/B verdict, 2026-08-27 —
plan 0077 records it); Inter was the other candidate and its ttfs and
license were removed with the verdict.
